ots 1
# journey-jukebox: Setup, Jukebox: change songs, stop/restart, toggle the text, play a
# sound effect; leave. Keys without a script name use SDL scancodes: 56 is /, 55 is .,
# 51 is ;.
# Authored against ot-ref-run (virtual clock); the title menu is ready at ~8.1 s.
# title: Setup
@8500 key-down DOWN
@8560 key-up DOWN
@8800 key-down DOWN
@8860 key-up DOWN
@9100 key-down DOWN
@9160 key-up DOWN
@9400 key-down DOWN
@9460 key-up DOWN
@9700 key-down RETURN
@9760 key-up RETURN
# Setup: Jukebox
@11200 key-down DOWN
@11260 key-up DOWN
@11500 key-down DOWN
@11560 key-up DOWN
@11800 key-down RETURN
@11860 key-up RETURN
# next song (Right), twice
@16100 key-down RIGHT
@16160 key-up RIGHT
@20400 key-down RIGHT
@20460 key-up RIGHT
# previous song (Left)
@24700 key-down LEFT
@24760 key-up LEFT
# stop (S), restart (R)
@28000 key-down S
@28060 key-up S
@29800 key-down R
@29860 key-up R
# toggle the text (Space)
@33100 key-down SPACE
@33160 key-up SPACE
@34900 key-down SPACE
@34960 key-up SPACE
# sound effects: toggle (/), next effect (.) twice, play it (;)
@36200 key-down 56
@36260 key-up 56
@37000 key-down 55
@37060 key-up 55
@37300 key-down 55
@37360 key-up 55
@37900 key-down 51
@37960 key-up 51
# quit the jukebox (Escape), Setup: Done
@40200 key-down ESCAPE
@40260 key-up ESCAPE
@43000 key-down DOWN
@43060 key-up DOWN
@43300 key-down RETURN
@43360 key-up RETURN
